   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1964",
   "x": 1707.9999999999995,
   "y": 1717.0,
   "width": 274.19999999999993,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "1. 循環と D3D12Wrapper は解消済み",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. 循環と D3D12Wrapper は解消済み",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 13768,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 60922,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1965",
   "x": 1707.9999999999995,
   "y": 1737.0,
   "width": 693.4000000000007,
   "height": 60.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    GraphicsDevice / CommandContext / FrameManager / BackBuffer に分けて\n    GraphicsEngine へ集約した。D3D12 層は Device* / HeapManager* を引数で受け取る。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    GraphicsDevice / CommandContext / FrameManager / BackBuffer に分けて\n    GraphicsEngine へ集約した。D3D12 層は Device* / HeapManager* を引数で受け取る。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 13775,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 60953,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1966",
   "x": 1707.9999999999995,
   "y": 1797.0,
   "width": 431.79999999999995,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. RayEngine は描画層の外に置かれたシングルトンのまま",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. RayEngine は描画層の外に置かれたシングルトンのまま",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 13782,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 60984,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1967",
   "x": 1707.9999999999995,
   "y": 1817.0,
   "width": 592.6000000000006,
   "height": 60.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    持ち主が居ないので MainEngine と RenderGraph が Instance() で引く。\n    GraphicsEngine の持ち物にすると ② と同じ所有ツリーに収まる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    持ち主が居ないので MainEngine と RenderGraph が Instance() で引く。\n    GraphicsEngine の持ち物にすると ② と同じ所有ツリーに収まる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 13789,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 61015,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
